    "markdown": "---\nnumber-sections: false\nprefer-html: true\n---\n\n# Team {.unnumbered}\n\n## Lecturers\n\n:::: {.content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n::: {style=\"text-align: center;\"}\n![](images/team/alam.png){.img-circle style=\"float:right;\" fig-alt=\"Headshot of Sahirul Alam\" width=\"100\"}\n:::\n::::\n\n[**Dr. Ir. Sahirul Alam, S.T., M.Eng.**](https://acadstaff.ugm.ac.id/sahirulalam) (he/his) is an Indonesian academic, researcher, and lecturer at Universitas Gadjah Mada in Yogyakarta, Indonesia. He currently serves as a faculty member in the Department of Electrical Engineering and Informatics within the Vocational College. In addition to his teaching duties, he holds the management position of Secretary for the Applied Bachelor in Internet Engineering Technology study program.\n\nDr. Alam's research interests lie at the intersection of advanced telecommunications, network optimization, and computational engineering. His academic work primarily focuses on wireless communication systems, RADAR signal processing, optimization methodologies, and Internet of Things (IoT).\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n:::: {.content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n::: {style=\"text-align: center;\"}\n![](images/team/solaeman.jpg){.img-circle style=\"float:right;\" fig-alt=\"Headshot of Achmad Solaeman\" width=\"100\"}\n:::\n::::\n\n[**Achmad Solaeman, S.Tr.T., M.Eng.**](https://acadstaff.ugm.ac.id/achmadsolaeman) (he/his) is an academic and lecturer in the Internet Engineering Technology program at the Vocational College, UGM. His expertise lies in Distributed Artificial Intelligence and Network Security, with active research in deep learning applications. He is dedicated to driving technological innovation and shaping future professionals in the networking and AI domains.\n\n## Lab assistants\n\n\n```{=html}\n\n<table class=\"tabel-team\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n  <colgroup>\n    <col style=\"widt